:: StoryTitle
Zombie Chase

:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "637D0CD9-6182-4ACE-9AF0-B6FB94AB090A",
  "format": "SugarCube",
  "format-version": "2.37.3",
  "start": "Home",
  "zoom": 1
}

:: StoryInit {"position": "100,100", "size": "100,100"}

:: Home
<div class="phone">Zombies are Stopped.
  <img src="../../img/zombies.png">
  <div class="mainTab"> <img src="../../img/bar.png">
    Zombies are <<= setup.zombieDist>> Steps Away!



      <div class="levelContainer">
        <div class="levelList"> Begin the Chase:
          <<button "Easy" "Chase">><<run setup.setMode('easy')>><</button>>
          <<button "Medium" "Chase">><<run setup.setMode('med')>><</button>>
          <<button "Hard" "Chase">><<run setup.setMode('hard')>><</button>>
          <<button "Impossible" "Chase">><<run setup.setMode('impossible')>><</button>>
        </div>
      </div>



  </div>
</div>

:: Chase
<div class="phone">Step Power: <span id="multi"></span>
  <img src="../../img/zombies.png">
  <img src="../../img/bar.png">
  <span id="zombieDist"></span>
  <span id="zombieCnt"></span><div class="mainTab"> <<button "Run!" >><<run setup.incZombieDist(1)>><</button>>

  <div class="extras" id="extras">Extras</div>
  <<button "Return" "Home">><<run setup.clearID()>><</button>>
  <<done>><<run setup.startChase()>><</done>>
  </div>
</div>

:: You Win
<div class="phone">Congrats
<<button "Return" "Home">><<run setup.reset()>><</button>>
</div>
:: You Lose
<div class="phone">You lose
<<button "Return" "Home">><<run setup.reset()>><</button>>
</div>